    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The anatomical site or specimen source from which the microbiological culture was obtained.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unique integer identifier for each microbiology lab record.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The name of the organism identified from the microbiological culture.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Time offset in minutes from the patient unit stay admission when the culture was taken.</rdfs:comment>
